{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-context-compression-improved#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-context-compression-improved","commit":"8651fa51bb14fb346fe75626f3f5e89d6d74cec3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-compression-improved 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的上下文压缩插件，通过可逆 preset overlay 将压缩栈接入非 Minimal 预设，并在设置界面提供多种压缩策略。它可压缩新产生或累积的工具结果、整理较早的工具输出、保留代码骨架，并展示节省统计与会话监控。用户可通过设置面板选择策略和阈值，也可用命令查看或控制面板及摘要开关。适合长时间运行、工具输出较多的 DeepSeek Harness 会话；需要支持的 Harness 版本，测量依赖对应 DeepSeek tokenizer。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/selector/src/index.ts:792","packages/selector/src/pruner.ts:1874","packages/selector/src/client/index.ts:381"]}
